      "parameters": {
        "width": 640,
        "height": 230,
        "content": "## Data · Database cleansing\nOn demand, reads every object of one type from the Bubble database, keeps the first of each set of duplicates as the master, and deletes the rest.\n\n**Platforms:** Bubble\n**Source and tests:** github.com/kimjoshuadr/n8n-workflows · `production/operations`"
      }
    },
